  <h2>The friction rehearsal tries to shrink</h2>
  <p>
    International lanes bill using whichever is worse between <strong>scale weight</strong> and <strong>volumetric weight</strong> (carrier divisor varies per line).
    Until cartons exist in three dimensions, dashboards interpolate using historical averages—fine for sneakers, cruel for vacuum-packed duvets or oddly boxed jackets sourced via <a href="/blog/kakobuy-spreadsheet-hubs-compared/">spreadsheet hubs</a>.
